---
import CustomLayout from '../../layouts/CustomLayout.astro';
---

<CustomLayout>
	<section
		id="inicio"
		class="relative flex min-h-screen items-center pt-20"
		style='background-image: url("https://readdy.ai/api/search-image?query=Professional%20modern%20law%20office%20interior%20with%20elegant%20wooden%20furniture%20and%20natural%20lighting%20creating%20a%20sophisticated%20and%20trustworthy%20atmosphere%20with%20clean%20minimalist%20design%20elements%20and%20warm%20ambient%20tones%20perfect%20for%20legal%20consultation%20space%20with%20subtle%20luxury%20details%20and%20professional%20ambiance%20featuring%20contemporary%20architecture%20and%20refined%20aesthetic%20appeal&width=1920&height=1080&seq=hero-bg-001&orientation=landscape"); background-size: cover; background-position: center center;'
	>
		<div
			class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900/95 via-slate-900/85 to-slate-900/60"
		>
		</div><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-32 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="max-w-3xl">
				<div class="mb-6">
					<span
						class="inline-block rounded-full bg-amber-600/20 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-400"
						>Abogado Especializado</span
					>
				</div><h2 class="mb-6 text-5xl leading-tight font-bold text-white md:text-6xl">
					Defensa Legal Profesional y Comprometida
				</h2><p class="mb-8 text-xl leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
					Con más de 15 años de experiencia, ofrezco asesoramiento legal integral en derecho civil,
					penal, laboral y mercantil. Tu tranquilidad es mi prioridad.
				</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
					<button
						class="inline-flex transform cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-600 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-white transition-all hover:scale-105 hover:bg-amber-700"
						>Consulta Gratuita<i class="ri-arrow-right-line ml-2"></i></button
					><button
						class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/30 bg-white/10 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-white backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:bg-white/20"
						>Ver Servicios</button
					>
				</div><div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-3 gap-8">
					<div class="text-center">
						<div class="mb-2 text-4xl font-bold text-amber-400">15+</div><div
							class="text-sm text-slate-300"
						>
							Años de Experiencia
						</div>
					</div><div class="text-center">
						<div class="mb-2 text-4xl font-bold text-amber-400">500+</div><div
							class="text-sm text-slate-300"
						>
							Casos Ganados
						</div>
					</div><div class="text-center">
						<div class="mb-2 text-4xl font-bold text-amber-400">98%</div><div
							class="text-sm text-slate-300"
						>
							Satisfacción
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section><section id="servicios" class="bg-slate-50 py-24">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="mb-16 text-center">
				<span class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider text-amber-600 uppercase"
					>Áreas de Práctica</span
				><h3 class="mt-3 mb-4 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">
					Servicios Legales Especializados
				</h3><p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-xl text-slate-600">
					Ofrezco asesoramiento legal integral en múltiples áreas del derecho, adaptándome a las
					necesidades específicas de cada cliente con profesionalidad y dedicación.
				</p>
			</div><div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
				<div
					class="group cursor-pointer rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-amber-200 hover:shadow-xl"
				>
					<div
						class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-amber-600"
					>
						<i
							class="ri-scales-3-line text-3xl text-amber-600 transition-colors group-hover:text-white"
						></i>
					</div><h4 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Derecho Civil</h4><p
						class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-600"
					>
						Asesoramiento en contratos, herencias, divorcios, reclamaciones de deudas y todo tipo de
						asuntos civiles con atención personalizada.
					</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
						<span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700">Contratos</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Herencias</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Divorcios</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Reclamaciones</span
						>
					</div><button
						class="mt-6 flex cursor-pointer items-center font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-amber-600 transition-colors hover:text-amber-700"
						>Más información<i class="ri-arrow-right-line ml-2"></i></button
					>
				</div><div
					class="group cursor-pointer rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-amber-200 hover:shadow-xl"
				>
					<div
						class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-amber-600"
					>
						<i
							class="ri-shield-check-line text-3xl text-amber-600 transition-colors group-hover:text-white"
						></i>
					</div><h4 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Derecho Penal</h4><p
						class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-600"
					>
						Defensa penal especializada en delitos, recursos y procedimientos judiciales con amplia
						experiencia en tribunales.
					</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
						<span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Defensa Penal</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700">Recursos</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700">Juicios</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Asesoramiento</span
						>
					</div><button
						class="mt-6 flex cursor-pointer items-center font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-amber-600 transition-colors hover:text-amber-700"
						>Más información<i class="ri-arrow-right-line ml-2"></i></button
					>
				</div><div
					class="group cursor-pointer rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-amber-200 hover:shadow-xl"
				>
					<div
						class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-amber-600"
					>
						<i
							class="ri-briefcase-line text-3xl text-amber-600 transition-colors group-hover:text-white"
						></i>
					</div><h4 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Derecho Laboral</h4><p
						class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-600"
					>
						Protección de tus derechos laborales, despidos improcedentes, accidentes laborales y
						negociación de convenios colectivos.
					</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
						<span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700">Despidos</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Accidentes</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Convenios</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Reclamaciones</span
						>
					</div><button
						class="mt-6 flex cursor-pointer items-center font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-amber-600 transition-colors hover:text-amber-700"
						>Más información<i class="ri-arrow-right-line ml-2"></i></button
					>
				</div><div
					class="group cursor-pointer rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-amber-200 hover:shadow-xl"
				>
					<div
						class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-amber-600"
					>
						<i
							class="ri-building-line text-3xl text-amber-600 transition-colors group-hover:text-white"
						></i>
					</div><h4 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Derecho Mercantil</h4><p
						class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-600"
					>
						Asesoramiento empresarial, constitución de sociedades, contratos mercantiles y
						resolución de conflictos comerciales.
					</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
						<span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Sociedades</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Contratos</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Conflictos</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700">Asesoría</span
						>
					</div><button
						class="mt-6 flex cursor-pointer items-center font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-amber-600 transition-colors hover:text-amber-700"
						>Más información<i class="ri-arrow-right-line ml-2"></i></button
					>
				</div><div
					class="group cursor-pointer rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-amber-200 hover:shadow-xl"
				>
					<div
						class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-amber-600"
					>
						<i class="ri-home-line text-3xl text-amber-600 transition-colors group-hover:text-white"
						></i>
					</div><h4 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Derecho Inmobiliario</h4><p
						class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-600"
					>
						Gestión integral de compraventa, arrendamientos, desahucios y todo tipo de transacciones
						inmobiliarias.
					</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
						<span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Compraventa</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Arrendamientos</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Desahucios</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Hipotecas</span
						>
					</div><button
						class="mt-6 flex cursor-pointer items-center font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-amber-600 transition-colors hover:text-amber-700"
						>Más información<i class="ri-arrow-right-line ml-2"></i></button
					>
				</div><div
					class="group cursor-pointer rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-amber-200 hover:shadow-xl"
				>
					<div
						class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-amber-600"
					>
						<i
							class="ri-group-line text-3xl text-amber-600 transition-colors group-hover:text-white"
						></i>
					</div><h4 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Derecho de Familia</h4><p
						class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-600"
					>
						Asesoramiento en separaciones, custodias, pensiones alimenticias y adopciones con
						enfoque humano y profesional.
					</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
						<span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Separaciones</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Custodias</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Pensiones</span
						><span class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700"
							>Adopciones</span
						>
					</div><button
						class="mt-6 flex cursor-pointer items-center font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-amber-600 transition-colors hover:text-amber-700"
						>Más información<i class="ri-arrow-right-line ml-2"></i></button
					>
				</div>
			</div><div class="mt-16 text-center">
				<button
					class="inline-flex transform cursor-pointer items-center rounded-lg bg-amber-600 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-white transition-all hover:scale-105 hover:bg-amber-700"
					>Solicitar Consulta<i class="ri-calendar-line ml-2"></i></button
				>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section><section id="sobre-mi" class="bg-white py-24">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="grid items-center gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2">
				<div>
					<img
						alt="Abogado Profesional"
						class="h-auto w-full rounded-2xl object-cover object-top shadow-2xl"
						src="https://readdy.ai/api/search-image?query=Professional%20confident%20lawyer%20attorney%20in%20elegant%20formal%20business%20suit%20standing%20in%20modern%20law%20office%20with%20sophisticated%20interior%20design%20featuring%20warm%20natural%20lighting%20and%20professional%20demeanor%20conveying%20trust%20expertise%20and%20reliability%20with%20clean%20background%20and%20contemporary%20office%20setting%20showcasing%20legal%20professional%20excellence%20and%20authority&width=800&height=1000&seq=lawyer-portrait-001&orientation=portrait"
					/>
				</div><div>
					<span class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider text-amber-600 uppercase">Sobre Mí</span
					><h3 class="mt-3 mb-6 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">Dr. Juan Carlos Martínez</h3><p
						class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600"
					>
						Licenciado en Derecho por la Universidad Complutense de Madrid y Doctor en Derecho
						Civil, cuento con más de 15 años de experiencia defendiendo los intereses de mis
						clientes con profesionalidad, dedicación y resultados comprobados.
					</p><p class="mb-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
						Mi compromiso es ofrecer un servicio legal de excelencia, basado en la confianza, la
						transparencia y la búsqueda constante de las mejores soluciones para cada caso. Cada
						cliente es único y merece una atención personalizada y estrategias adaptadas a sus
						necesidades específicas.
					</p><div class="mb-8 space-y-4">
						<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
							<div
								class="flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-100"
							>
								<i class="ri-award-line text-2xl text-amber-600"></i>
							</div><div>
								<h5 class="mb-1 font-bold text-slate-900">Colegiado Nº 12345</h5><p
									class="text-slate-600"
								>
									Ilustre Colegio de Abogados
								</p>
							</div>
						</div><div class="flex items-start gap-4">
							<div
								class="flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-100"
							>
								<i class="ri-medal-line text-2xl text-amber-600"></i>
							</div><div>
								<h5 class="mb-1 font-bold text-slate-900">Especialista Certificado</h5><p
									class="text-slate-600"
								>
									Derecho Civil y Penal
								</p>
							</div>
						</div><div class="flex items-start gap-4">
							<div
								class="flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-100"
							>
								<i class="ri-graduation-cap-line text-2xl text-amber-600"></i>
							</div><div>
								<h5 class="mb-1 font-bold text-slate-900">Formación Continua</h5><p
									class="text-slate-600"
								>
									Actualización permanente
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div><div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6">
						<h5 class="mb-4 flex items-center font-bold text-slate-900">
							<i class="ri-star-fill mr-2 text-amber-500"></i>Valores Profesionales
						</h5><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-amber-600"></i><span class="text-slate-700"
									>Integridad</span
								>
							</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-amber-600"></i><span class="text-slate-700"
									>Compromiso</span
								>
							</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-amber-600"></i><span class="text-slate-700"
									>Experiencia</span
								>
							</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-amber-600"></i><span class="text-slate-700"
									>Resultados</span
								>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section><section id="contacto" class="bg-slate-50 py-24">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="mb-16 text-center">
				<span class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider text-amber-600 uppercase">Contacto</span
				><h3 class="mt-3 mb-4 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">
					Solicita tu Consulta Gratuita
				</h3><p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-xl text-slate-600">
					Estoy aquí para ayudarte. Contáctame y resolveré todas tus dudas legales con la máxima
					profesionalidad.
				</p>
			</div><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
				<div>
					<form class="space-y-6" data-readdy-form="true" id="contact-form">
						<div>
							<label for="nombre" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900"
								>Nombre Completo *</label
							><input
								id="nombre"
								required=""
								class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-4 py-3 text-sm transition-all outline-none focus:border-amber-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-600/20"
								placeholder="Tu nombre completo"
								type="text"
								value=""
								name="nombre"
							/>
						</div><div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
							<div>
								<label for="email" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900"
									>Email *</label
								><input
									id="email"
									required=""
									class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-4 py-3 text-sm transition-all outline-none focus:border-amber-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-600/20"
									placeholder="tu@email.com"
									type="email"
									value=""
									name="email"
								/>
							</div><div>
								<label for="telefono" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900"
									>Teléfono *</label
								><input
